; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1059, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I rewrote the ancient documents among the storehouse's books into a form that even people of the present day could readily understand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">'From this point on, important matters are written down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I have translated them into the language of today, so that our descendants may read them even a little more easily. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Please, put this to good use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I do not have long now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">1942, the Grand Witch, Kikyo Niimura'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">After the Fierce Sound, she appeared.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was the true Goddess.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="はる">Long</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ago a girl had died, and yet she had become a bewitching flower and come again into this world.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="と">Those possessed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> vanished just like that and became cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A little way from the settlement, several cherry trees had sprung up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But these were no ordinary cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Those who had vanished had simply become cherry trees and sprung up anew where the cherry trees stood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">As proof, their clothes were wound around the roots of the cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">The bewitching flower that descends in the month of death―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka is filled with rage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Her lost offshoot was carried off by </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たいこうでんか">His Highness the Taiko</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and she seeks to have us reborn as new cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">We know who will vanish and become cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Those who have used Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Anyone who has ever used Droga, or their children, will be enthralled by Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Those so enthralled turn into cherry trees and become a part of Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That was not all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Along with the Goddess, countless giant cherry trees sprang up, big enough to swallow the mountains.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The earth grew barren, the water dried up, and this land of Arata died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What was more, the dead overran that land.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Those clad in white robes tried to carry off the living.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">We racked our brains and succeeded in driving off Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We sent the dead back to the underworld, destroyed the giant cherry trees, and brought the earth back to life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In doing so, we offered up the surviving green-eyed as sacrifices.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It was thanks to their sacrifice that we were able to destroy Shigatsu Youka and the Goddess.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But then that incident occurred.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The last green-eyed girl, Tomi.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We had thought the threat of Shigatsu Youka would not arise again, but Tomi, driven by that murderous intent, took her own life.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka is still alive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Unless Shigatsu Youka, and the Goddess who controls Shigatsu Youka, are utterly destroyed, there will be no peace here in Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">People of Arata yet to come, our descendants.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hand down faithfully to the generations after you what we now set forth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And when Shigatsu Youka, the Goddess, appears, you must destroy it without fail.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">'The dead come forth from the underworld, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who have become corpses also become bewitching flowers and come forth from the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Only the green-eyed prevail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who have become green-eyed wither the bewitching flowers and return the dead to the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The descendants shall without fail don blood-red garb, and resist.'</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With this, I have done what had to be done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What remains for me to do:
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Administer falsificaso to the residents
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Seal the Verde mummy
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, the residents should be freed from the curse of Droga―
{PAUSE ""}
of Shigatsu Youka.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
